    "bg": "00003",
    "bgm": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001020010,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……はい、そうですね",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200102/1002001020010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そろそろ仕事やイルミネーションスターズには慣れたか？\r\n新人アイドルはやることが多くて大変だからな",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001020020,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……はい",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200102/1002001020020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（……なんだか、灯織の表情が暗いな）",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "灯織、大丈夫か？\r\n体調でも悪いのか？",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001020030,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……いえ、体調は万全です\r\nただ、その……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200102/1002001020030"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001020040,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "プロデューサー、先日の顔合わせのときは\r\n申し訳ありませんでした",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200102/1002001020040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え？　先日って自己紹介のときか？",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001020050,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "はい。あのような失礼な態度をとってしまって\r\n反省しています……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200102/1002001020050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（それを気にしていて暗い顔をしていたのか……）",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "大丈夫だ、気にしてないよ",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001020060,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……そうですか\r\n少し安心しました",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200102/1002001020060"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001020070,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "それと実は、今日の仕事は少し緊張していて……\r\n返事もちゃんとできなくて、すみません",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200102/1002001020070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか、緊張か……",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "次は新しい現場\r\nだったな",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "まぁ、大丈夫だろう",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "手のひらに\r\n人という字を……",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "text": "//★選択肢①【次は新しい現場だったな】"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001020080,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "はい、できる限りの準備はしたつもりですが……",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200102/1002001020080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（だいぶ不安を感じているようだな）",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……よし、なら『10分前に次の現場に\r\n到着できたら仕事は成功する』これで行こう！",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001020090,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……何ですか、急に\r\n話の意図が見えません",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200102/1002001020090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なに、マイルールっていうか\r\n即席のジンクスみたいなものだ",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001020100,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "ジンクス……",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_angry",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200102/1002001020100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ジンクスだって意外とバカにできないぞ？\r\nそれだけで、なんだか大丈夫な気がしてくるもんだからな",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001020110,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……なるほど、わかりました\r\nでは、それを叶えるためにも急ぎましょう",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200102/1002001020110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え？\r\nあ、ああ。そうだな……",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001020120,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "プロデューサー？\r\nどうしました？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_angry",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200102/1002001020120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、まさかノッてくれるとは\r\n思わなかったから……",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001020130,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "別に……プロデューサーに\r\n合わせたわけじゃありませんよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200102/1002001020130"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001020140,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "もともと、ジンクスとかはちょっと好きというか……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200102/1002001020140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "へえ……",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（てっきり非現実的だとバッサリ切られるかと\r\n思ったんだが……）",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（何から何までストイックというわけでは\r\nないんだな……）",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……って、待て灯織！　俺を置いていくな！",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "se": "0116",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "x": 200,
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 450
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001020150,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "待ちません。今からでも10分前には間に合いますが\r\n念のためもっと早めの到着を目指します",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "002",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/100200102/1002001020150"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001020160,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "さあ、急ぎますよ、プロデューサー",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200102/1002001020160"
  },
  {
    "text": "//★選択肢②【まぁ、大丈夫だろう】"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001020170,
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……根拠もないのに、どうして簡単に言えるんですか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200102/1002001020170"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001020180,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "お仕事なんですから\r\nもっと真面目にやってください",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200102/1002001020180"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001020190,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……すみません\r\n私、またキツい言い方を……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200102/1002001020190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いいって、いいって。気にするな",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でもな、俺も何の根拠もなく\r\n言ったわけじゃないぞ？",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なにせ今朝のテレビの占いによると\r\n今日の俺の運勢は最高、仕事は成功間違いなしだからな！",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001020200,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "え？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_angry",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200102/1002001020200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺の仕事の成功ってことは\r\n灯織の成功ってことでもあるからな、だから大丈……",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001020210,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……本当ですか？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200102/1002001020210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あ、ああ、本当だよ\r\n馬鹿にするかと思ったが、意外と食いつくんだな",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001020220,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "すみません……今日の私の運勢は\r\n良くも悪くもなかったので……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200102/1002001020220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "へぇ、そうだったのか\r\n灯織も、占いとか見るんだな",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001020230,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "はい。気づまりしたときなんかに時々、ですけど……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200102/1002001020230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（呆れさせて肩の力を抜いてもらおうと\r\n思っただけなんだが……）",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（思わぬところで、\r\n意外な灯織の一面を知ることができたな）",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001020240,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "あの、プロデューサー。もう少し占いの話を\r\nうかがってもよろしいでしょうか？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200102/1002001020240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、じゃあ歩きながら話そうか",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（結局、ただの気休めになってしまったが……\r\nま、結果オーライだな）",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "se": "0117",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "text": "//★選択肢③【手のひらに人という字を……】",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001020250,
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "３回書いて飲み込む、ですか？\r\nそれはもうやりました",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200102/1002001020250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なんだ、そうだったのか……って、え？",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001020260,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……何ですか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200102/1002001020260"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あ、いや。ジンクスに頼るなんて、\r\nよっぽど緊張しているんだなって……",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001020270,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……別に、緊張してるからというわけではないです",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200102/1002001020270"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001020280,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "占いとかジンクスとかなら\r\n普段から使っているというか……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_angry",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200102/1002001020280"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え？　普段からか？",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001020290,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "はい……って何ですかその顔は？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200102/1002001020290"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（いつも自分に厳しくて、冷静な子だとばかり\r\n思っていたが……）",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（さっきの謝罪といい、ジンクスといい\r\n案外、不器用なところもあるんだな）",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001020300,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "プロデューサー、\r\nいつまでしまらない顔をしているんですか",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
